{"id":"word:hebrew:H5656","type":"word","title":"עֲבֹדָה","subtitle":"H5656 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"work of any kind","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֲבֹדָה (H5656) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 145 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֲבֹדָה (ʻăbôdâh) means work of any kind First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֲבֹדָה","transliteration":"ʻăbôdâh","pronunciation":"ab-o-daw'","strong":"H5656","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5656","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["עֲבֹדָ֖ה","עֲבֹדַ֥ת","עֲבֹדַ֖ת","לַ/עֲבֹדַ֖ת","עֲבֹדָתֽ/וֹ"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc",38],["HNcfsa",21],["HTd/Ncfsa",16],["HR/Ncfsc",16],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",13],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",12],["HR/Ncfsa",8],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",5],["HC/Ncfsa",4],["HC/Ncfsc",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"work of any kind","usage":"act, bondage, bondservant, effect, labour, ministering(-try), office, service(-ile, -itude), tillage, use, work, × wrought.","full":"H5656. abodah עַבֹדָה , and (Chronicles) עֲבוֺדָה 145 noun feminine labour, service (on formation see Lag BN 179 Ba NB 61 ); — ׳י Exod 1:14 41t.; construct עֲבֹדַת 30:16 43t.; suffix עֲבֹדָתִי Gen 30:26 33 t. suffixes; in Chronicles עֲבוֺדָה 1Chr 28:14 7 t.; construct עֲבוֺדַת 6:33 13 t.; suffix עֲבוֺדָתִי 2Chr 12:8 ; עֲבוֺדָתָם 1Chr 6:17 ; 2Chr 31:16 ; — 1 labour, work , Psa 104:23 ; in the field Exod 1:14 ; 1Chr 27:26 , probably Neh 10:38 ( ע ׳עָרֵי ), Psa 104:14 ( לע ׳עֵשֶׂב ); in fine linen 1Chr 4:21 ; in erection of tabernacle Exod 35:24 ; 36:1 , 3 , 5 ; 39:42 (P); in repairing temple 2Chr 34:13 (twice in verse); תעשׂוּ לא עבדה מלאכת כל ye shall do no laborious work Lev 23:7-8 , 21 , 25 , 35 , 36 ; Num 28:18 , 25 , 26 ; 29:1 , 12 , 35 (P); figurative of man, ׳ע הַצְּדָקָה Isa 32:17 (|| הַצּ ׳מַעֲשֵׂה ); of God's work of judgment 28:21 (twice in verse). 2 labour of servant or slave: of Jacob for Laban Gen 29:27 ; 30:26 (JE); ׳ע עֶבֶד of bondservant Lev 25:39 (P); of the Nethinim Ezra 8:20 ; service of things, vessels of tabernacle and temple Num 4:26 , 32 (P) 1Chr 9:28 ; 28:14 (twice in verse); 28:15 . 3 labour, service of captives or subjects: of Israel in Egypt Exod 1:14 ; 2:23 (twice in verse) (P), 5:11 (E), 6:6 (P); כבד(הׅ ׳הע 5:9 (E) Neh 5:18 ; ׳ע קשׁה Exod 1:14 ; 6:9 (P) Deut 26:6 ; 1Kin 12:4 2Chr 10:4 ; Isa 14:3 ; ע ׳מֵרֹב Lam 1:3 ; ׳ע ממלכוֺת 2Chr 12:8 ; ׳ע המלך 1Chr 26:30 ; ׳ע אדניהם Neh 3:5 ; military service Ezek 29:18 (twice in verse). 4 service of God, in P Chronicles, Ezra: by people Josh 22:27 (P) 2Chr 12:8 , feast of passover Exod 12:25-26 , 2Chr 35:10 , 16 , unleavened bread Exod 13:5 ; Levites and priests Num 4:19 , 49 ; 8:11 ; 1Chr 24:3 , 19 ; 2Chr 8:14 ; 31:16 ; ׳ע מתנה Num 18:7 ; Levites Exod 38:21 ; Num 4:24 , 27 (twice in verse); 4:28 , 33 , 47 (twice in verse); 7:7-8 , 8:26 ; 18:21 ; 1Chr 6:17 ; 2Chr 31:2 ; with מוֺעֵד בְּאֹהֶל 31:4 ; 2 Chronicles 31:23; 2 Chronicles 31:31; 2 Chronicles 31:33; 2 Chronicles 31:35; 2 Chronicles 31:39; 2 Chronicles 31:43; 2Chron 8:19; 8:22; 18:31 ; מוֺעֵד אֹהֶל Exod 30:16 ; Num 4:30 ; 7:5 ; 8:24 ; 18:4 , 6 , 21 , 23 , compare Exod 35:21 ; Num 7:5 ; (ה)מִשְׁכָּן Exod 39:32 , 40 ; Num 3:7-8 , 16:9 ; 1Chr 6:33 , compare Exod 27:19 ; Num 3:36 ; 1Chr 23:26 ; ׳ע הַקֹּדֶשׁ Num 7:9 , compare 3:31 ; of its court 3:26 ; more specifically ׳ע משׂא 4:47 ; הע ׳צבא 8:25 ; ׳ע י ׳בית (ה)אלהים 1Chr 23:24 , 28 , 32 ; 25:6 ; 28:13 (twice in verse); 28:21 (twice in verse); 29:7 ; 2Chr 29:35 ; 31:21 ; 35:2 ; Neh 10:33 ; ע ׳מלאכת האלהים בית 1Chr 9:13 ; 28:20 ; 2Chr 24:12 ; ע ׳מעשׂה 1Chr 23:28 ; its service Ezek 44:14 ; 1Chr 9:19 ; specific service of Levitical singers 25:1 (twice in verse), and doorkeepers 26:8 ; 2Chr 35:15 . [ עֲבִידָה ] noun feminine work, service (Biblical Hebrew עֲבֹדָה ); — emphatic עֲבִידְתָּא Ezra 5:8 ; Dan 2:49 , construct עֲבִידַת Ezra 4:24 +; — 1 work , of building temple, Ezra 4:24 ; 5:8 ; 6:7 ; = administration Dan 2:49 ; 3:12 . 2 ritual, service , of God Ezra 6:18 .","rootNote":"or עֲבוֹדָה ; from 5647 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 21","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 21","1Chr 6 17","1Chr 6 33","1Chr 9 13","1Chr 9 19","1Chr 9 28","1Chr 23 24","1Chr 23 26"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":145,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲבֹדַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲבוֹדָתָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 33","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲבוֹדַ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲבוֹדַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֲבוֹדָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֲבוֹדָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/עֲבֹדַ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/עֲבֹדָתֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/עֲבֹדַת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲבֹדַ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/עֲבֹדַ֖ת","source":"hebre